UID:019c7342-69a3-534f-21ed-faf3305454b8@academymuseum.org
CATEGORIES:Conversations
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, May 16\, 2026 at 2 pm\n\nLocation: Level 4\n\nCost:
  Free with general admission\n\nType: Conversations\n\nCostume designer an
 d Academy member Isis Mussenden gives a 30-minute tour that pieces togethe
 r the art of costume design in films and the process of creating a charact
 er’s identity. The tour will showcase the way the three leading men in J
 aws (1975) highlighted their identity through their distinct costumes. \nS
 tay for a brief Q&A with Mussenden after the tour.
LOCATION:Level 4
URL:https://www.academymuseum.org/en/programs/detail/inside-jaws-costuming
 -characters-019c7342-69a3-534f-21ed-faf3305454b8
