 of Motion Pictures\n\nRuntime: 1h 56m\n\n1991 | 116 min. | UK/USA | Color 
 | English | Rated R | 35mm\nDIRECTED BY: Joel Coen  \nWRITTEN BY: Joel Co
 en\, Ethan Coen  \nWITH: John Turturro\, John Goodman\, Judy Davis\, Mich
 ael Lerner  \nPrint courtesy of the Ed and Maya Herrera collection at the
  Academy Film Archive.\n\nType: Screenings\n\n“I’ve always been drawn 
 to the Coen Brothers\,” Bong Joon Ho says in the catalog for the exhibit
